  "design": {
    "idea": "Draining the port bilge exposes a sunken Blue Transformer to rotate, while rolling back to port slides a fenced cargo crate onto the sluice plate and leaves a clean cross-water blue bank.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Alternating port/starboard ballast solves two-stage water-drain and crate-weight dependencies.",
    "decisions": 5,
